  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neo I Solar Power Plant, through CDM International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to OnePower Lesotho Limited (&quot;OnePower&quot;) will fund a feasibility study and technological design work (&quot;Study&quot;) for the development of a 20-megawatt solar power plant near Mafeteng, Lesotho. The project is anticipated to be the first solar independent power production project in Lesotho. Arup USA, Inc. is completing the Study which will support OnePower to address critical technical, financial and legal requirements to implement the power plant.</narrative>
  </description>
